Bundled third-party content
---------------------------

intel2sigma/data/examples/*.yml are Sigma rules curated from the SigmaHQ
rule corpus (https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma), redistributed under the
MIT License per that project's root LICENSE. Original authorship is
preserved in each file's header alongside the upstream source URL and the
commit they were curated from.

intel2sigma/data/mitre_attack.json is derived from the MITRE ATT&CK STIX
2.1 export (https://github.com/mitre/cti). ATT&CK is a registered
trademark of The MITRE Corporation; see
https://attack.mitre.org/resources/legal-and-branding/terms-of-use/ for
MITRE's terms.

web/static/vendor/ contains vendored JavaScript with upstream sources and
SHA-256 hashes recorded in web/static/vendor/HASHES.md. Each retains its
own upstream license.
